      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'll use that overview for the executive summary. However, I need to be more specific for the engineering lead. \n\nCould you elaborate on the technical challenges of maintaining strong consistency in a horizontally scaled environment? Specifically, I'm looking for a breakdown of the trade-offs involved with CAP theorem implications—how do we handle the latency vs. consistency conflict when nodes are distributed across different availability zones? Please keep the tone professional and technical.",
